  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#CoCreate Light C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#CoCreateMyCity encourages collaboration between different groups in the entrepreneurship ecosystem, like the government, knowledge institutes, and the private sector. The purpose is to get unique and innovative business ideas. These ideas can help solve agricultural and circular challenges in various cities in C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire.By joining this initiative, students will learn an entrepreneurial mindset. They can use this mindset in other areas of their lives. The goal is to create an atmosphere that supports young people and women in developing successful and sustainable businesses, leading to more job opportunities and innovation in and outside Abidjan where infrastructure and facilities for entrepreneurs are limited.</narrative>
  </description>
